  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Green Financing Platform (GFP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The GFP is a catalytic mechanism, designed to unlock and channel private and blended capital for green development projects by strengthening sustainable finance ecosystems, developing bankable project pipelines, and improving access to financing for SMEs. Through targeted tools - such as green bonds, carbon pricing, debt-for-nature swaps, and tax incentives - anchored in national frameworks like Integrated National Financing Frameworks (INFFs) and NDCs, GFP translates policy into tangible invest</narrative>
  </description>
